## 6. Future Roadmap

### Short-Term Goals (Q2 2026)
- Finalize and release 'beta' version of the benchmark dataset.
- Address remaining latency issues in model integration.
- Conduct additional investor demonstrations.

### Medium-Term Goals (Q3-Q4 2026)
- Expand dataset coverage to new domains.
- Fully automate the annotation pipeline.
- Conduct large-scale stress testing and scalability optimizations.

### Long-Term Goals (2027+)
- Develop proprietary model leveraging benchmark dataset insights.
- Explore partnerships with industry leaders for dataset application.
- Establish recurring revenue streams through dataset licensing.

